        "eyebrow": "HandPicked.pk",
        "heading": "Original branded clothing in Pakistan",
        "text": "<p>HandPicked is where Pakistan shops 100% original branded clothing at outlet prices. Browse polos, tees, shirts, hoodies and jackets from Hugo Boss, Ralph Lauren, Lacoste and 60+ other international labels, sourced as export surplus and outlet stock.</p><p>Order with cash on delivery anywhere in Pakistan, and our team confirms every order on WhatsApp. Delivery takes 2–4 working days to Karachi, Lahore and Islamabad/Rawalpindi, and 4–7 working days elsewhere. Wrong size? Enjoy a 7-day free size exchange.</p>",
